    "detectionBenchmark": "Measure detection capability against frozen expectations.",
    "targetRepair": "Mutate target working copy after grounded diagnosis.",
    "productDevelopment": "General repository/product development outside bug-detection improvement; uses normal development contract, not a detection lane.",
    "detectionGap": "Explicit handoff when current stable bug-detection capability cannot support a claim; not a map defect."
  },
